Giuseppe runs his own live server. Never start one for this project: no `python -m http.server`, `npx serve`, Live Server, or any other local preview server, even to verify UI.

Use his already-running server if a page needs to be checked in the browser. If it is not reachable, say so and stop. Do not launch a substitute.
